Description: BOSS-Sentinel — PC health monitor with interactive autohealing
 BOSS-Sentinel is a Debian-native GTK4 desktop application that monitors
 CPU, memory, disk, temperature, GPU, network and process health in a
 minimal blue UI. Critical faults ask Yes/No before autoheal. Ships with
 a systemd user daemon, polkit helper and desktop launcher.
